         j²  =  —1    =>     arg(j²)  =  +π

      ... quarter-circles (π/2 jumps).

      Had conjugation been taught this way,
      Chapter VIII (Stephen Butterworth) would have been
      an ice-cream-day-dream-blue-sky-sunshine lazy walk in the park...
      Hence this edit.
  */



